{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C", "description": "This file implements a Linux kernel driver for a switch register access bridge component (SRAB) used in networking hardware. It defines register addresses, bit masks, and functions for requesting grant, releasing grant, reading, and writing various sizes of data to the switch registers. The file includes platform driver probe and remove functions, along with module information.", "external_files": ["<linux/kernel.h>", "<linux/module.h>", "<linux/platform_device.h>", "<linux/platform_data/b53.h>", "b53_priv.h"], "external_methods": ["readl", "writel", "usleep_range", "WARN_ON"], "published": ["b53_srab_probe", "b53_srab_remove", "b53_srab_ops"], "classes": [], "methods": [{"name": "int b53_srab_request_grant(struct b53_device * dev)", "description": "Requests control grant from the switch register access bridge, with retry logic and a warning if not granted.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "void b53_srab_release_grant(struct b53_device * dev)", "description": "Releases control grant back to the switch register access bridge.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_op(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u32 op)", "description": "Performs an operation on a switch register, such as read or write, specified by the 'op' parameter.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read8(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u8 * val)", "description": "Reads an 8-bit value from a specified register in the switch.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read16(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u16 * val)", "description": "Reads a 16-bit value from a switch register.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read32(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u32 * val)", "description": "Reads a 32-bit value from a switch register.", "scope": "", "scopeKind": ""}, {"name": "int b53_srab_read48(struct b53_device * dev,u8 page,u8 reg,u64 * val)", "description